# Google OAuth for the Nocturnal extension (untracked — copy to .env and fill in).
# Extension ID: kipdkhhnfoggaalehloecmmlhpmbpkjk
# Redirect URI: https://kipdkhhnfoggaalehloecmmlhpmbpkjk.chromiumapp.org/
# Full walkthrough: ./oauth-setup.md
#
# Client must be type "Web application". The client_secret is NOT bundled here —
# the backend holds it and performs the auth-code exchange. The extension needs
# only the public client_id. The backend MUST exchange with this SAME OAuth client.
# Prefer a dedicated Google Cloud project/client for Nocturnal.
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
